    "question_text": "What is 25% as a fraction?",
    "options": [
      { "value": "1/4", "label": "1/4" },
      { "value": "1/2", "label": "1/2" },
      { "value": "1/5", "label": "1/5" }
    ],
    "correct_answer": "1/4",
    "hint": "25 out of 100. Can you simplify that?",
    "worked_solution_steps": [
      "25% means 25 out of 100.",
      "25/100 — both divide by 25.",
      "25 ÷ 25 = 1, 100 ÷ 25 = 4.",
      "So 25% = 1/4 ✅"
    ],
    "analogy": "25p is a quarter of £1. 25% is a quarter of anything!"
